Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): upstream edf994c0 (one LS diag gate per direction) replaces 1035's WWS range test; `SPU_HOT` kept on the accessors.

diff --git a/runtime/spu/spu_context.h b/runtime/spu/spu_context.h
